Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.49,0:00:06.24,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,We began to build a vehicle that could fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:12.41,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,We'll leave this place with this...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:16.92,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,...and we'll go to a more fun and livelier world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.71,0:00:22.01,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,If it gets cold, she won't be able to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:24.97,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:36.60,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,We worked without rest.
