Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:48.80,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}and you become a distant figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.83,0:01:48.80,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf89}to{\kf44}o{\kf201}ku {\kf84}na{\kf59}ru {\kf219}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:51.09,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I will always remember...
