Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.18,0:01:57.93,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}though it's a plain thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.18,0:01:57.93,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf24}a{\kf23}ri{\kf20}fu{\kf23}re{\kf19}ta {\kf18}mo{\kf21}no {\kf21}da{\kf29}ke{\kf40}do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:02:01.89,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}I will show it to you, this one thing covered in glory.
