Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.89,0:02:07.15,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}{\kf19}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf21}ma{\kf27}de{\kf17}mo {\kf14}i{\kf32}tsu{\kf19}ma{\kf21}de{\kf17}mo {\kf23}ma{\kf23}mo{\kf22}t{\kf16}te {\kf27}i{\kf200}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.41,0:02:13.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you done with your parent-teacher conference?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.95,0:02:21.58,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. And since I can't think of something I want to study at college, I'm thinking of finding a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:24.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And you've got good grades, too... What a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.21,0:02:27.46,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What will you do once you graduate? {ep 8}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:36.81,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey... Is there anything you want as a present?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.81,0:02:40.10,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Is it related to graduation?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.48,0:02:44.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, not really, but I suddenly felt the urge to give you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:50.20,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You're trying to change the subject again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.20,0:02:53.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I can't accept a present for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.99,0:02:58.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Isn't wanting to give something to\Nyour loved one a good enough reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:03:03.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,If that was true, then I'd have to give you something every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.84,0:03:13.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,{\fs78.3}Anyway, if we stick to those rules, then gift exchanges would happen only on birthdays and at Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.55,0:03:16.51,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,In that case, I'd have only one day to receive presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.39,0:03:18.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.27,0:03:21.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I was born on December 24th.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:25.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why did you have to be born on that day of all days?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:28.23,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please complain about that to Dad and Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.57,0:03:32.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,All right! Let's go on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.95,0:03:35.07,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,A date?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:39.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If you're not going to take a present, then a date it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:40.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:43.00,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:44.79,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.50,0:03:48.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm going to head up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.38,0:03:50.17,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:53.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No. We were talking about your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.47,0:03:55.09,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:04.31,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 9
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:04.31,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}On the Sloped Path
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.81,0:04:07.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,My future, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:09.19,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Good morning, Okazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.19,0:04:10.98,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,And a toilet seat cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.98,0:04:12.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You did that one already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:15.11,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You've got a really gloomy face so early in the morning. {ep 8}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.11,0:04:17.66,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Did you have a fight with Nagisa-chan? {ep 8}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.87,0:04:21.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey... Have you figured out what you want to do after here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:23.79,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:29.09,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,To not worry my lovely sister, I've thought things through seriously and have come to a conclusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:30.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:32.71,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yeah! I'm going to make money with my looks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:35.88,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,A model, I tell you. A model!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:36.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,A model?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.89,0:04:40.26,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I think I'm fit to be a model.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:43.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's possible to shift into entertainment business through modeling, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.85,0:04:44.52,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:46.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I might become famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:51.40,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'll put lots of young ones under\Nmy spell and form the Sunohara Legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.40,0:04:53.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You really are an optimist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.99,0:04:57.36,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,My future is blessed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:02.04,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,It works! Sunohara-kun, you can become a model!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.04,0:05:03.91,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Really?! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:06.16,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,You'll become a really popular model.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:10.63,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,You will be able to go into the entertainment industry and form the Sunohara Legion, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.63,0:05:12.05,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.05,0:05:15.34,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki! I'll draft you into my legion one day, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:17.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:22.39,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Everyone other than me is a senior here, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:25.31,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,Do you all know what you'll be doing after you graduate?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.31,0:05:28.65,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'm planning on going to nursing school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.65,0:05:30.56,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,It's what I've wished to do for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:33.32,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'm aiming to become a kindergarten teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:35.53,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,So I'm going to a school that gives me the necessary degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.78,0:05:42.12,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I think... I'll be studying abroad in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.41,0:05:46.20,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,It'll be sad to say goodbye to everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:50.92,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,but I'll come back to Japan as often as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.59,0:05:55.71,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,We won't be able to listen to\Nyour breathtaking violin anymore, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.05,0:05:58.01,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,If you crave for it, I can play it-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.01,0:05:59.22,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:00.93,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Keep your thoughts to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:07.77,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You've got to learn to read into things a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.77,0:06:10.90,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm working on it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:13.23,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,She's being very rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.07,0:06:16.49,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,What will you be doing, Okazaki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:19.78,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I heard you haven't even decided whether to go to college or get a job, {merge in 16.9}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:22.95,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,even running away from teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.33,0:06:28.54,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Come on, Nagisa. You've got to spank Tomoya's butt more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.50,0:06:30.42,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.79,0:06:33.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Nagisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:38.84,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I feel a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:39.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:43.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's got a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:50.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You don't have to be with Nagisa-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.85,0:06:53.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,A doctor's at home right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.52,0:06:56.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If I'm there, I'm sure I'd make things awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.61,0:06:58.32,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:07:01.57,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Sunohara. You've got a phone call from your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.36,0:07:04.03,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Righty-o.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.41,0:07:06.95,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Anything you want to say to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.95,0:07:09.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Tell her to come visit again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:12.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, but don't tell her Nagisa's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.96,0:07:14.04,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.92,0:07:17.21,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:18.92,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Furukawa-san's sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.34,0:07:22.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's not very healthy to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:27.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's repeating this year because she was short on her attendance last year for the same reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.64,0:07:29.47,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.69,0:07:36.61,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Make sure you do a good job taking care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:48.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.79,0:07:50.54,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:54.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't bother. Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:56.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.63,0:07:59.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:01.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. Have a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.67,0:08:03.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Get a good rest, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:04.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:11.56,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Aren't you worrying too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:14.48,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's happened before, too, hasn't it? {ep 8; change}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:15.06,Default-alt,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi! Puhi! Puhi! Puhi! Puhi! Puhi! Puhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:19.27,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Last time Nagisa-chan got sick,\Nyou were out of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.27,0:08:21.53,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I mean, at crucial times, you're... {ep 8}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.53,0:08:23.61,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi-puhi-puhi. Puhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:24.03,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.53,0:08:27.16,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.53,0:08:28.12,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.78,0:08:30.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Did you come to see Kyou, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.74,0:08:31.66,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:33.25,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.33,0:08:36.83,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Oh, you weren't trying to eat her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:39.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't attack before finding out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:42.76,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,What should we do with her? Can you go home alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:44.13,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi puhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.13,0:08:46.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Looks like she wants to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.89,0:08:50.81,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Impossible. I have PE this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:52.35,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Can you babysit her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:53.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:57.44,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,That's not right. Besides, I'm her owner, too, so I'll-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.44,0:08:58.23,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.94,0:08:59.61,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi puhi puhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.69,0:09:02.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She doesn't like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:03.74,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:07.03,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I tried to put her in the bath some time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:11.41,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,but the water was too hot and it made her think I was planning on stewing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.41,0:09:12.62,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi puhi puhi puhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:15.04,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Therefore, take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:13.29,Default-alt,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.04,0:09:18.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're gonna make me sit through class with this on my lap?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:18.25,Default-alt,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi puhi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:19.50,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Botan, doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:20.38,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Pu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.38,0:09:22.84,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It's one of Botan's seven tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:28.22,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,If you hold her like that,\Npeople will think of you as a doll-maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.56,0:09:36.39,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:40.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You owe me bigtime for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:43.53,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'll treat you to fruit milk tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.53,0:09:44.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:46.44,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.95,0:09:52.45,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,We were thinking of paying a visit to Furukawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.45,0:09:56.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, unfortunately, they said they were taking her to the hospital today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:10:00.08,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I see. Then give her our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:00.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:02.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,See you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:10.22,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I hope it took his mind off things a little. {ep 8}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.80,0:10:08.55,Default-alt,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi? {ep 8}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:11.34,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi... {ep 8}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:14.93,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun isn't happy. {ep 8}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.93,0:10:18.56,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,He can be very sensitive at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:23.36,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I hope Nagisa-chan gets well soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:28.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,A month went by.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.57,0:10:32.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa didn't get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:39.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,One day, when she was feeling well, she forced her way to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.37,0:10:44.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But her fever went back up after only walking part-way to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:47.92,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,How were exams?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:49.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So-so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:52.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thanks to going to more classes than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.31,0:10:57.06,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,This is your test break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:11:00.64,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please don't worry about me and go play.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:05.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let me stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.57,0:11:09.28,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It'll be boring to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:15.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I'll wait here. That's enough fun for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:18.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Wait? Until what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.41,0:11:22.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The day we can hold hands and walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:29.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We're together at home and school,\Nbut we didn't have much chance to be alone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:33.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So I wanted to go on a date with you and hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.89,0:11:36.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We're alone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.31,0:11:39.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.69,0:11:43.65,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Will you hold my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:03.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,November came.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:08.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,With entrance exams coming, seniors studied frantically.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:13.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,In an environment like that,\Nthe only thing on my mind was Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.47,0:12:17.10,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Here are the tapes of theater you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.10,0:12:21.60,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I chose some that are fun and\Ngive you energy just from watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:24.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:27.61,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,We owe you a big favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.61,0:12:28.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:33.99,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san, did you lose some weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:37.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.45,0:12:40.95,Default,TV,0,0,0,,Allow me to invite you to our, the cats' world, in return!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:42.95,Default,TV,0,0,0,,Wow, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.46,0:12:47.08,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The autumn went by like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:55.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The tension in the air started to build, and winter drew near.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.93,0:13:00.72,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,We figured you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.10,0:13:06.52,Default,San,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san. Nagisa might end up repeating her senior year again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:11.48,Default,San,0,0,0,,She can't take her exams,\Nand she'll be short on attendance, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:18.07,Default,San,0,0,0,,The teachers said that she should withdraw from school and focus on getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:20.99,Default,San,0,0,0,,We are not worried about her educational record.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:22.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But Nagisa's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.49,0:13:26.41,Default,San,0,0,0,,We want to leave it to Nagisa to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.41,0:13:31.34,Default,San,0,0,0,,So even if she can't graduate, please accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:34.42,Default,San,0,0,0,,Please, Okazaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.30,0:13:39.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.93,0:13:44.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I want to graduate with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:48.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't want to leave her behind there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:50.77,Default,San,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.61,0:13:55.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If Nagisa isn't going to graduate, then I don't want to either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.57,0:14:00.53,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What a child you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.28,0:14:04.99,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,If you do something like that,\NNagisa will be hurt even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.45,0:14:06.91,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You understand that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.92,0:14:09.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.67,0:14:12.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:19.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I felt like I'd become a little better, being able to help some friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:23.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,but the girl I love may not be able to graduate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:30.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was such a child that it was enough to put me at a loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.31,0:14:36.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When December came, everything became busier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:40.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Entrance exams. College applications. Job searches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:43.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was left out of the groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.29,0:14:54.79,Default,2,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.79,0:14:56.80,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Nagisa-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:14:58.97,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,And, Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.97,0:15:01.63,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You sure have energy for a rejected applicant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.14,0:15:05.43,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,He seriously sent an application to a modeling agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.43,0:15:07.18,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It was my right to!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:10.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'll be looking for a job near\Nmy home next year, so it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:15.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.98,0:15:19.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Here's my present.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.74,0:15:24.12,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's Dango!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.17,0:15:37.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:47.56,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.89,0:15:49.72,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Being here for someone like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:54.81,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't say things like, "someone like me", Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:58.98,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You're part of our precious family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.82,0:16:04.20,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,He's right. And our precious friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.74,0:16:09.20,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,If you are happy, then so are Sanae and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:13.41,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,So seize your happiness, Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.05,0:16:21.42,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes. I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.05,0:16:29.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That was Christmas Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:31.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa's birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.81,0:16:35.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,and also the day Nagisa's need to repeat became definite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.69,0:16:41.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,After the New Year's, fewer seniors came to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:44.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was with Nagisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:49.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Small and fragile, but someone who continued to work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.83,0:16:52.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wanted to protect her forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.58,0:16:59.34,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1200,0)}Sign: Hikarizaka Private High School Graduation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.34,0:17:03.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sunohara. Want to go around breaking some windows after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:05.30,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:09.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I thought I might be able to repeat the year if I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:12.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Rather than being forced to repeat, you'd probably get kicked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.47,0:17:14.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.77,0:17:16.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then that's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:21.19,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Oh, Okazaki and Sunohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.19,0:17:22.69,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Congratulations for graduating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.69,0:17:23.48,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.48,0:17:26.20,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I'll be retiring after this year, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.20,0:17:30.12,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I'll be graduating with you guys, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.12,0:17:30.99,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.99,0:17:35.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was hoping the Theater Club would be solid with you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:39.00,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Don't worry about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:42.63,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,She's much stronger and\Nmore level-headed than you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:45.63,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,You two are the ones who have to work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.63,0:17:51.93,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I was lucky to meet students who needed a lot of my attention in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:57.64,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,If you hadn't set us straight, we probably would've been kicked out long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.02,0:18:05.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I've been wondering for a while, but did you purposely have Sunohara and me meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.49,0:18:07.45,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.95,0:18:09.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sunohara and I are alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.45,0:18:14.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,When either has a friend, neither would quit school that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.41,0:18:16.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Isn't that what you thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.91,0:18:19.87,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.21,0:18:22.88,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,After all, I'm pretty old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:26.09,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,You guys will be members of society starting tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.09,0:18:30.72,Default,Kou,0,0,0,,Be sure you attend your last homeroom, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.81,0:18:38.39,Default,2,0,0,0,,Thank you for your guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.48,0:18:41.98,Note,,0,0,0,,Sign: Hikarizaka Private High School Graduation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:44.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thanks for a lot of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:46.53,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,That's for us to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.53,0:18:49.57,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,It's been decided that the sakura trees will remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.57,0:18:51.24,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,This is all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:54.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa will be in your class next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:56.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Please look after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.74,0:18:59.41,Default,Tom,0,0,0,,We know. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.41,0:19:02.08,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Best of luck to you, Okazaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.08,0:19:03.25,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:05.80,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,We're headed to a party after this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:07.76,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,but you've got somewhere to be, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.01,0:19:09.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:22.85,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sweet bean bread! {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.65,0:19:28.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,...shouted out a complete lie without thinking! {S1 ep 15}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.57,0:19:31.15,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnEraserDust\fs180\c&HD2DBDD&\pos(591,972)\blur1.3}Nagisa
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.15,0:19:36.15,Signs,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.39,0:19:58.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You idiot! You shouldn't be outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.60,0:20:02.31,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I wanted to see you no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.94,0:20:05.69,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You in your uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.24,0:20:15.41,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun. Congratulations on graduating.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.88,0:20:27.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.38,0:20:30.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I graduated...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.09,0:20:32.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.05,0:20:38.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I won't ever be a student at that school again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:41.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I hated school,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.52,0:20:43.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,but if it was with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.35,0:20:48.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wanted to spend all my time there forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.90,0:20:51.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,My student life was rotten as hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.74,0:20:57.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,but the last year I spent with you was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:01.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.12,0:21:06.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I should have repeated, too, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.67,0:21:09.75,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.01,0:21:15.88,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You can't stop like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.30,0:21:18.97,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,If you can move on, then you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:21.64,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.27,0:21:30.23,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll do my best for another year.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:33.69,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.70,0:21:37.53,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Can we hold hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.86,0:21:42.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You idiot. Your fever's going to go up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:44.29,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Just for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.29,0:21:47.33,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I want to walk holding hands with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:57.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wanted to keep on walking without stopping...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.30,0:22:01.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...walking on and on...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.85,0:22:04.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...even the endless uphill climb...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.43,0:22:06.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...just the two of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.89,0:22:09.85,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(1459.999969,840)\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5}To be continued
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.78,0:22:26.29,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.78,0:22:26.29,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:33.34,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's color.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:33.34,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:41.39,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:41.39,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:48.48,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colors fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.39,0:22:48.48,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:55.78,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.48,0:22:55.78,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:04.41,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.78,0:23:04.41,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.45,0:23:12.00,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.45,0:23:12.00,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:19.55,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small sign leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:19.55,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:27.10,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.55,0:23:27.10,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:34.61,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.10,0:23:34.61,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.61,0:23:39.86,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.61,0:23:39.86,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:43.57,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.28,0:23:44.62,Default,San,0,0,0,,What are your plans from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.62,0:23:46.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nothing in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.28,0:23:50.04,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Do you want to work for us for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.04,0:23:50.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.75,0:23:53.33,Default,San,0,0,0,,I look forward to working with you, Tomoya-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.33,0:23:54.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"Tomoya-san"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.92,0:23:56.67,Default,San,0,0,0,,Please let me call you by name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.50,0:24:01.01,Default,San,0,0,0,,Since we're like family now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.13,0:24:04.80,Note,,0,0,0,,Sign: Apartments
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.10,0:24:09.72,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 10
